        "edit": "No change: the supplied RTL already matches the oracle behavior for the observed mismatch (ABC=3'b100 yields X=0,Y=0, i.e. 00, not the expected 10). The evidence appears inconsistent with the provided buggy RTL, so no local repair can be derived from it.",
